{"id":"9fdac2ae842859473f0949901e619d75c554fee0","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242151","title":"开源分享 ProxyLane - 拖拽即透明代理的开源工具","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"le4tim","excerpt":"程序员 - @le4tim - 把你要走代理的应用(例如 chatgpt.exe ，cmd.exe )拖到这个工具启动，被启动的应用以及其子进程才会走过你指定的代理 Profile 。不使用全局 Tun ，不修改系统全局代理设置，其","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>把你要走代理的应用(例如 chatgpt.exe ，cmd.exe )拖到这个工具启动，被启动的应用以及其子进程才会走过你指定的代理 Profile 。不使用全局 Tun ，不修改系统全局代理设置，其他应用进程不影响。</p>\n<p>例如打开 ProxyLane ，设置一个 profile （通常是你的梯纸的 HTTP/Socks5 协议的代理地址和端口）。\n然后往 ProxyLane 界面拖入 chatgpt.exe 就可以， 如果拖入 cmd 启动这个命令行窗口，这个窗口里执行的 codex 、git 、curl 、npm 、pip 甚至浏览器等等自动透明代理。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/threatexpert/ProxyLane\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/threatexpert/ProxyLane</a></p>\n<p>这个代码库有 90%以上的 C++代码是多年前手搓的，一直自己用。最近用 AI 优化了一下易用性，感觉值得分享一下。</p>\n</div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/开源\"><li></li> 开源</a><a href=\"/tag/代理\"><li></li> 代理</a><a href=\"/tag/工具\"><li></li> 工具</a></P><p><span>22 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-16 11:04:10 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087963\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c5f/8507/73740_normal.png?m=1786580340\" alt=\"ragnaroks\" data-uid=\"73740\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ragnaroks\">ragnaroks</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 15:53:40 +08:00\">20h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看说明是 hook 不能用于网络游戏加速吧？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087974\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c5f/8507/73740_normal.png?m=1786580340\" alt=\"ragnaroks\" data-uid=\"73740\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ragnaroks\">ragnaroks</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 15:54:44 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>接上：</p><p>以前有个叫 sockscap 的，使用方式也是这样，忘了内部如何实现代理的了，但是大多数游戏的反作弊无影响</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088861\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8b5b/655a/110693_normal.png?m=1761911438\" alt=\"le4tim\" data-uid=\"110693\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/le4tim\">le4tim</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:06:52 +08:00\">18h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ragnaroks\">ragnaroks</a> 网络游戏加速的场景方面我没实测过。不确定网络加速需要的原理。<br>我这个主要还是给一些应用透明代理，例如 pip ，github ，国外大模型。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088937\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/49f9/52a9/183654_normal.png?m=1608000412\" alt=\"konchu\" data-uid=\"183654\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/konchu\">konchu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:24:34 +08:00\">17h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>UWP 都可以代理真不错，不用开 tun 分流</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088972\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/97c2/a0ff/166121_normal.png?m=1788512377\" alt=\"changdy\" data-uid=\"166121\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/changdy\">changdy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:31:49 +08:00\">17h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>好巧 sockscap ProxyBridge  Netch 之类的 有好多同类型作品.   建议互相比较.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089319\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5c9a/a4ef/89315_normal.png?m=1420015815\" alt=\"nnfish\" data-uid=\"89315\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nnfish\">nnfish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 20:22:40 +08:00\">15h 53m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>开源自用多年的工具，很赞</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089321\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7121/0eb9/222090_normal.png?m=1789119518\" alt=\"iorilu\" data-uid=\"222090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iorilu\">iorilu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 20:22:42 +08:00\">15h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>可以啊， 这种方式其实是最自然的</p><p>各种配置的很多人也整不明白</p><p>有空试试</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089649\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b609/0248/18343_normal.png?m=1427247554\" alt=\"intret\" data-uid=\"18343\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/intret\">intret</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 22:47:35 +08:00\">13h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>好东西，用了 proxifier 很多年，发誓有一天要开发一款简单易用的软件能自动设置进程代理，并识别软件所有连接的地址，以便将网址放到代理匹配名单中，下次自动代理</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089708\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8a56f04a5df632bf7375fa37387b38ef?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"laris\" data-uid=\"77204\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/laris\">laris</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 23:21:55 +08:00\">12h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gonc 大佬的作品哈哈<br>linux/mac 下有 ng-proxychains 好像也很经典了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089963\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d984/45c6/421672_normal.png?m=1716778816\" alt=\"tramm\" data-uid=\"421672\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tramm\">tramm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 07:57:41 +08:00\">4h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这头像对劲吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18090356\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f5bb36251732b59d0919eabff53eba4d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yangyn\" data-uid=\"361730\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yangyn\">yangyn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 09:34:14 +08:00\">2h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/le4tim\">le4tim</a> #16 大佬这款工具昨天试用过了，很方便，是想要的。另外，建议大佬把 L 那边的头像也同步下 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18090811\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ae6d/bbc5/621091_normal.png?m=1789018581\" alt=\"StoneHuLu\" data-uid=\"621091\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/StoneHuLu\">StoneHuLu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 10:23:51 +08:00\">1h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>喜欢，之前为了让 cursor 用 http2 的方式访问 claude 的模型，一直用的 proxifier ，感觉很麻烦，需要！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18090921\">